---
// Standar Regulasi & Keselamatan section with Primary Dark Green (#1E482C) and Pure White (#FFFFFF)
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 bg-[#1E482C] text-white border-b border-white/10" aria-label="Standar Baku Mutu dan Keselamatan Emisi">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Technical Features & CTA -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6 sm:space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Standar Rekayasa Termal & Regulasi Emisi
          </h2>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Feature Cards in Deep Green (#153620) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#153620] border border-white/15 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-tech uppercase tracking-wide">
              DUAL CHAMBER ≥ 800°C
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
              Ruang bakar primer & secondary afterburner suhu tinggi untuk destruksi tuntas.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#153620] border border-white/15 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-tech uppercase tracking-wide">
              RETENSI GAS ≥ 2 DETIK
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
              Waktu tinggal gas buang panas untuk mengurai senyawa hidrokarbon dan bau.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#153620] border border-white/15 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-tech uppercase tracking-wide">
              CYCLONE WET SCRUBBER
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
              Pemisah partikulat fly ash & semprotan air penetral gas emisi cerobong.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Description Paragraph -->
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
          Seluruh mesin dirancang mengacu pada standar baku mutu PermenLHK Nomor P.70/MENLHK/SETJEN/KUM.1/8/2016. Dilengkapi sertifikasi pengujian emisi udara independen dan garansi keandalan struktur ruang bakar.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Button in Clean White with Dark Green text -->
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="/permintaan-penawaran/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 sm:py-4 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-[#1E482C] font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wide transition-colors duration-150 shadow-lg shadow-black/20"
          >
            <span>Minta Spesifikasi Teknis SPH</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#1E482C]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
              <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Compliance Checklist Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#153620] border border-white/15 shadow-md space-y-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
            Daftar Kepatuhan Teknis & Keselamatan Operasional
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-emerald-400">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm">
                <span class="font-bold text-white block">Standar Emisi KLHK P.70/2016</span>
                <span class="text-white/80">Kadar partikulat, CO, SO2, NOx, dan opasitas gas buang di bawah ambang batas baku mutu.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-emerald-400">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm">
                <span class="font-bold text-white block">Suhu Permukaan Luar Dingin (± 40°C)</span>
                <span class="text-white/80">Insulasi bata api SK-34 dan selimut keramik rockwool menjamin keamanan operator saat bekerja di dekat unit.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-emerald-400">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm">
                <span class="font-bold text-white block">Interlock Pintu Loading & Emergency Stop</span>
                <span class="text-white/80">Sistem penguncian mekanis dan tombol darurat instan untuk mencegah paparan api balik saat pengisian sampah.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-emerald-400">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm">
                <span class="font-bold text-white block">Cerobong Sampling Hole Standar Uji Emisi</span>
                <span class="text-white/80">Dilengkapi lubang sampling dan platform tangga inspeksi untuk uji laboratorium lingkungan berkala.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>